   "anchor": "start"
  },
  {
   "text": "1 model call \u00b7 \u2248 8,000 input tokens \u00b7 \u2248 2 s \u00b7 can do anything \u00b7 pays the full call on every turn",
   "x": 170,
   "y": 299,
   "font_size": 11,
   "color": "#6B7280",
   "anchor": "start"
  },
  {
   "text": "The same turn on each route. Customer: \u201cI\u2019m Yusuf Rossi, zip 19122, I want to exchange the keyboard in order #W2378156.\u201d",
   "x": 640,
   "y": 40,
   "font_size": 14,
   "color": "#374151",
   "anchor": "middle"
  },
  {
   "text": "Where they part: three turns later the customer asks for the specifications of the replacement items.",
   "x": 640,
   "y": 330,
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#374151",
   "anchor": "middle"
  },
  {
   "text": "Jev route: no template answers, the call is transferred.   LLM route: the model answers.   Evolution\u2019s job: give the Jev route a hand-to-LLM step for exactly such turns.",
